OL,3,CProgramme listings for SAT 18 APR
OL,4,G0600FSounds of the 60s with Tony
OL,5,     FBlackburn
OL,6,     GTony brings you two hours of
OL,7,     Gmusic from the best decade ever,
OL,8,     Gwith hits from Pink Floyd, Lesley
OL,9,     GGore and Jackie Wilson. This
OL,10,     Gweek, the top three comes from
OL,11,     G1966.
OL,12,G0800FDermot O'Leary
OL,13,     GBlur's Alex James chats about the
OL,14,     Gnew Record Store Day vinyl
OL,15,     Greleases - and plans for this
OL,16,     Gyear's Big Feastival. Plus a
OL,17,     Gwedding call and The Mystery
OL,18,     GVoice.
OL,23,Vppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
